      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the hospital's calm approach to treating nervous dogs and cats, particularly senior pets and rescues. Reviewers mention that staff members will sit on the floor to comfort anxious animals before initiating examinations or medical treatments. Clients value the low-stress environment created for vulnerable companion animals."
