      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight the clinic's open communication regarding treatment plans, diagnosis options, and associated costs. Reviewers note that Dr. Clive explains medical conditions in understandable terms and frequently suggests helpful follow-up reading. Owners also appreciate receiving routine telephone check-ins after treatments to monitor recovery."
      }
